<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 80-day NCDs average yield at 4.943 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 80-day NCDs average yield at 4.943 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Wednesday issued T$5 billion in 80-day negotiable certificates of deposits at an average yield of 4.943 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the yields was between 4.920 and 4.990 percent. Demand totalled T$19.2 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
